[{"i":"5962","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">关于齿轮传动说法正确的有哪些？（ ）</p><p></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>能够精确地计算传动比</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><br><p></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>能够有缓冲作用保护机械</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><br><p></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>适合近距离传动</span></p><p></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span>适合远距离传动</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p>分析齿轮传动的物理特性与运动传递机制。齿轮通过轮齿啮合实现动力传递，啮合过程中无相对滑动，可确保输入与输出之间的转速关系恒定。轮齿的刚性接触不具备弹性变形能力，无法吸收冲击或振动。传动结构要求两轴间距固定且较近，增加中间齿轮可调节布局但不改变传动距离本质限制。远距离传动需依赖其他形式的中间连接方式。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"5963","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p><span>关于齿轮传动说法正确的有哪些？（</span><span> </span><span>）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span>大齿轮带动小齿轮起加速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span>小齿轮带动大齿轮起加速作用</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span>两轮啮合，半径大的齿轮齿数多</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span>两轮平行啮合旋转方向相同</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p>分析齿轮传动关系时，需考虑主动轮与从动轮的相对大小对转速的影响；齿轮的齿数与其半径成正比关系；平行轴上啮合的两个齿轮，其旋转方向相反；通过比较输入输出端齿轮的尺寸差异，判断转速变化趋势；根据齿轮啮合的基本几何原理确定旋转方向和齿数分布规律。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"5967","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>关于模型中的手摇把手说法正确的有哪些？（</span><span> </span><span>）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><br></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span>手柄越长越省力</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>相当于省力杠杆</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><br></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span>相当于费力杠杆</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span>相当于等臂杠杆</span></p>"}],"a":"A,B","an":"<p>分析手摇把手的力学结构，确定其支点、动力作用点和阻力作用点的相对位置。根据杠杆原理，比较动力臂与阻力臂的长度关系。若动力臂大于阻力臂，则形成省力杠杆；若动力臂小于阻力臂，则形成费力杠杆；若两者相等，则为等臂杠杆。手柄长度影响动力臂大小，手柄越长，动力臂越长。通过几何关系判断手摇过程中力臂的变化情况，明确其在工作状态下属于何种杠杆类型。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["省力杠杆和费力杠杆"]},{"i":"5969","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p><span>下列关于传动比计算正确的有哪些？（</span><span> </span><span>）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span>齿齿轮带动</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span>齿齿轮，传动比为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1:2<o:p></o:p></span></p><br></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span><span>齿齿轮带动</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span>齿齿轮，传动比为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2:1<o:p></o:p></span></p><br></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span>主动轮半径比从动轮半径为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1:3</span><span>，传动比为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">3:1</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span>主动轮半径比从动轮半径为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1:3</span><span>，传动比为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1:3</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p>计算齿轮传动比时，传动比等于从动轮齿数与主动轮齿数之比。若以半径替代齿数进行计算，传动比同样遵循从动轮半径与主动轮半径之比。传动比表达形式为输出量与输入量的比值关系，其数值反映转速变化方向与幅度。当主动轮带动从动轮时，转速与齿数或半径成反比关系。根据几何参数确定传动比时，需明确主动件与从动件的对应位置，并依据齿数或半径比例建立比值关系。比值顺序由驱动关系决定，前者为主动，后者为从动。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念"]},{"i":"5993","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>实操题</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">(1)\r\n</span><span>搭建说明</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>搅拌器是我们经常使用的厨房用具，特点是：通过手摇把缓慢的转动，其顶端的机械能够快速的转动。下面请考生制作一个搅拌器。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">(2)\r\n</span><span>搭建要求</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">a</span><span>）具备搅拌器的大体结构框架；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">b</span><span>）具备二级传动装置；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">c</span><span>）有摇手把手及搅拌部分的机械展示；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">d</span><span>）实现摇手部分低速转动，搅拌部分高速旋转的效果。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">(3)\r\n</span><span>器材说明</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">(4)\r\n</span><span>案例样图</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例一<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-01-27/8489866361395437568.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例二<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-01-27/8489866361479323648.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例三<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-01-27/8489866361579986944.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例四<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-01-27/8489866361672261632.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例五<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-01-28/8489866361764536320.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例六<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-01-28/8489866361869393920.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p><br></p>","o":[],"a":"<p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>搭建说明</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>搅拌器是我们经常使用的厨房用具，特点是：通过手摇把缓慢的转动，其顶端的机械能够快速的转动。下面请考生制作一个搅拌器。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span>搭建要求</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>1.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>具备搅拌器的大体结构框架；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>2.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>具备二级传动装置；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>3.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>有手摇及搅拌部分的机械展示；</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>4.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>实现手摇部分低速转动，机械顶端高速旋转的效果。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>二、评分说明</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span></b><b><span>、整体框架（</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">40</span></b><b><span>分）</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span>）作品零件结构是否和样例模型基本一致、结构完整，<span>具备①模型框架、②手摇把手、③二级传动的齿轮装置、④搅拌部分的体现、以上四点缺少一点扣</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span>分，缺少两点及两点以上扣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span>分。（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span>分）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span>）作品相应部件的固定可靠程度</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">;</span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span>分）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<br>\r\n</span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span>）作品的整体协调性和美观性。（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span>分）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></b><b><span>、动力传递</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span></b><b><span>表现形式（</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span></b><b><span>分）</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span>）缓慢摇动手摇把手，搅拌器头部加速旋转</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">;</span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span><span>分）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<br>\r\n</span><span>（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span>）作品整体动作顺利流畅。（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">15</span><span>分）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></b><b><span>、完成时间（</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span></b><b><span>分）</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br>\r\n</span><span>在考试时间内完成得</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span>分，超时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span>分钟扣</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span>分，超时</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span>分钟以上不结束操作总成绩记为</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span><span>分。（</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><span>分）</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>三、器材说明</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例一</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-16-00-31-10/8490357022875934720.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例二</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-16-00-31-10/8490357022959820800.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span>样例三</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-16-00-31-10/8490357023039512576.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例四</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-16-00-31-10/8490357023127592960.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span>样例五</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-16-00-31-10/8490357023211479040.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>样例六</span></p><p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-16-00-31-10/8490357023295365120.png\" alt=\"undefined\"></p><br><p></p>","an":"","sc":80.0,"kp":["齿轮组变速比例的计算","齿轮和齿轮比的概念","二级传动装置"]}]